  "note": "Sumi to Kinpaku's kit (kit/): ro-iro lacquer frames with a crest line of cut gold leaf, the shared gilt on act-now, the row tier's frames (kit/_row/), and the badge ring, seat and glyph in gen.py badge()'s order. The Hand seat is the tank seat in Medallion's Hand enamel. The Decoration ornaments (kit/ornaments/) ship as a whole-pixel strip, each sprite at the sizes the size rule gives it: the crest sigil from 13 px, the small sigil at 10-12 px only, the 2 px lozenge (times the UI scale) below 10 px, and the kamon corner mark from 15 px (so its leaf bar is at least a device pixel).",
